      "doc_id": "rbi-12702",
      "quote": "Once an account has been red-flagged, the entire process of classification of the account as fraud or removal of red-flagged status shall ordinarily be completed within 180 days from the date of first reporting of the account as red-flagged on the CRILC platform. Cases remaining in red-flagged status beyond 180 days shall be reported to the SCBMF for review with adequate reasoning / justification thereof."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 0.9,
  "rationale": "The clause states the timeline for completing the classification or removal of a red-flagged account but omits the mandatory requirement to report cases remaining in red-flagged status beyond 180 days to the SCBMF for review with adequate reasoning and justification."
}
